   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Angeline the Baker**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-09-15.sbd.ak40.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 18 songs; 99 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A three-year-old named Rylan, Drew Matulich's son, played guitar; some crowd noise during the encore break was removed without losing banter [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-09-15.sbd.ak40.flac24**: taped by Gordon & Lucinda Wilson; transferred by Gordon Wilson; source: SBD + Neumann ak40 (din) > Nick mod lc3 > Naiant PFA > Audioroot Femto > Tascam DR-70D @ 24/48 [1]. Also: Source is a soundboard plus mics, run through Nick mod LC3, Naiant PFA and Audioroot Femto preamps; remastered from raw wav files in September 2022 [1]",
